---

<Layout title="About Ayoub">
    <section class="container max-w-5xl mx-auto print:hidden">
        <header class="container max-w-2xl px-6 pt-24 pb-8 mx-auto">
            <span
                class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"
                >Fancy meeting you!</span
            >
            <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-5xl">
                A little about me
            </h1>
        </header>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-12">
            <Portrait client:load />

            <div
                class="max-w-2xl px-6 mx-auto leading-loose text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"
            >
                <p>
                    So, as you've probably guessed, my name is <strong
                        class="text-foreground">Ayoub</strong
                    >. I was born in <strong class="text-foreground"
                        >Morocco</strong
                    > but I've lived most of my life in <strong
                        class="text-foreground">Italy</strong
                    > after moving there with my family when I was around 3. Still
                    can't get over that first snowy december day, it was magical!
                </p>
                <p>
                    I'm now 25 years old and I'm currently living in <strong
                        class="text-foreground">Padua</strong
                    >
                    where I'm working as a <strong class="text-foreground"
                        >Freelance</strong
                    > developer and designer. I've mostly worked in startups and small
                    companies, dabbling with the occasional bigger reality when the
                    opportunity arose but I definitely think I thrive in smaller environments
                    where I can be more hands-on with all aspects of the products
                    I'm working on.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I'm a fairly adventurous person, I love <strong
                        class="text-foreground">traveling</strong
                    >,
                    <strong class="text-foreground">extreme sports</strong> and anything
                    that allows me to live life to the fullest. I'm also a huge <strong
                        class="text-foreground">foodie</strong
                    > and I love trying out new restaurants and cuisines.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I've also been getting deeper and deeper into the weird
                    Coffee rabbit hole and I've spent the past year honing my
                    home barista game. I've been dedicating a lot of my free
                    time to Longboard dancing and freeride ever since the start
                    of the pandemic and I'm involved with several projects in
                    that field as well.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cv">
        <header
            class="container max-w-2xl px-6 pt-24 pb-8 mx-auto print:hidden print:pt-0"
        >
            <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-snug md:text-5xl">
                Curriculum Vitae
            </h1>
        </header>

        <div
            class="container grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 px-6 py-10 mx-auto mb-48 gap-x-10 md:gap-x-32 sm:gap-y-16 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-cv print:grid-cols-cv print:pt-16 bg-muted"
        >
            <header
                class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:col-span-2"
            >
                <img
                    src="/brand/logo_mark.svg"
                    alt="Logo"
                    class="h-20 dark:hidden"
                />
                <img
                    src="/brand/logo_light_mark.svg"
                    alt="Logo"
                    class="hidden h-20 dark:block"
                />

                <div
                    class="grid sm:grid-flow-col grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 grid-rows-3 gap-x-6 gap-y-0.5"
                >
                    {
                        CONTACT_LINKS.map(({ href, label, icon, iconType }) => (
                            <a
                                href={href}
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
                            >
                                <svg
                                  class="size-3.5 shrink-0"
                                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                  fill={iconType === "fill" ? "currentColor" : "none"}
                                  stroke={iconType === "stroke" ? "currentColor" : "none"}
                                  stroke-width={iconType === "stroke" ? "2" : undefined}
                                  stroke-linecap={iconType === "stroke" ? "round" : undefined}
                                  stroke-linejoin={iconType === "stroke" ? "round" : undefined}
                                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                  set:html={icon}
                                />
                                {label}
                            </a>
                        ))
                    }
                </div>
            </header>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 print:pb-12">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-2xl">
                    Ayoub Aabass
                </h3>
                <span
                    class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"
                >
                    Senior Full-stack developer and designer
                </span>
            </div>
            <p
                class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"
            >
                Hey there! My name is Ayoub and I am a full-stack software
                developer and designer. I focus on conceptualizing and creating
                powerful and intuitive user interfaces to enable organizations
                and individuals to solve complex problems through digital tools.
            </p>

            <h5
                class="mt-0 text-base font-bold leading-tight md:text-lg xs:mt-12"
            >
                Current dev knowledge
            </h5>
            <div
                class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-2 gap-y-1 sm:gap-y-2 sm:grid-cols-3 print:grid-cols-3"
            >
                {
                    DEV_SKILLS.map((skill) => (
                        <span class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
                            {skill}
                        </span>
                    ))
                }
            </div>

            <h5
                class="mt-0 text-base font-bold leading-tight md:text-lg xs:mt-12"
            >
                Current design knowledge
            </h5>
            <div
                class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-2 gap-y-1 sm:gap-y-2 sm:grid-cols-3 print:grid-cols-3"
            >
                {
                    DESIGN_SKILLS.map((skill) => (
                        <span class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
                            {skill}
                        </span>
                    ))
                }
            </div>

            <h5
                class="mt-0 text-base font-bold leading-tight md:text-lg xs:mt-12"
            >
                Work experience
            </h5>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                {
                    EXPERIENCE.map((job) => (
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-xs leading-none md:text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                <strong class="text-foreground">
                                    {job.period} / {job.location}
                                </strong>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-sm md:text-base md:leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
                                {job.role}
                                {job.company ? ` @${job.company}` : ""}
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
